temp folder for assets/
temp-avatar/
temp-*/

# Local-only personal notes / TODOs (Vite-style .local convention — never committed)
*.local.md
*.local.txt

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# JSDoc output
docs/

# Synced into the docs template's static/ folder by `npm run docs:sync-tokens`
# — source of truth lives at src/styles/tokens.css.
jsdoc-template/static/styles/tokens.css

# Claude Code metadata
.claude/
